#, lua-format
msgctxt "goal-incCall"
msgid ""
"[%s in %s] Medical emergency: Engineering research scientist Terrence "
"Forsythe has contracted a rare medical condition. After contacting nearly "
"every station in the area, we found that doctor Geraldine Polaski on %s has "
"the expertise and facilities to help. However, we don't have the necessary "
"transport to get Terrence there in time - he has only a few minutes left to "
"live. Can you take Terrence to %s?"
msgstr ""

